{"verse_key": "10:38", "surah": 10, "verse": 38, "text_uthmani": "أَمْ يَقُولُونَ ٱفْتَرَىٰهُ ۖ قُلْ فَأْتُوا۟ بِسُورَةٍ مِّثْلِهِۦ وَٱدْعُوا۟ مَنِ ٱسْتَطَعْتُم مِّن دُونِ ٱللَّهِ إِن كُنتُمْ صَـٰدِقِينَ", "translation": "Or do they say [about the Prophet (ﷺ)], \"He invented it?\" Say, \"Then bring forth a sūrah like it and call upon [for assistance] whomever you can besides Allāh, if you should be truthful.\"", "verse_from_ms": 958830, "verse_to_ms": 978790, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "أَمْ", "start_ms": 958830, "end_ms": 959490}, {"i": 1, "text": "يَقُولُونَ", "start_ms": 959490, "end_ms": 960710}, {"i": 2, "text": "ٱفْتَرَىٰهُ", "start_ms": 960710, "end_ms": 963130}, {"i": 3, "text": "ۖ", "start_ms": 963131, "end_ms": 964190}, {"i": 4, "text": "قُلْ", "start_ms": 964190, "end_ms": 965050}, {"i": 5, "text": "فَأْتُوا۟", "start_ms": 965050, "end_ms": 966180}, {"i": 6, "text": "بِسُورَةٍ", "start_ms": 966180, "end_ms": 967590}, {"i": 7, "text": "مِّثْلِهِۦ", "start_ms": 967590, "end_ms": 968500}, {"i": 8, "text": "وَٱدْعُوا۟", "start_ms": 968500, "end_ms": 968800}, {"i": 9, "text": "مَنِ", "start_ms": 968800, "end_ms": 970120}, {"i": 10, "text": "ٱسْتَطَعْتُم", "start_ms": 970120, "end_ms": 971400}, {"i": 11, "text": "مِّن", "start_ms": 971400, "end_ms": 972060}, {"i": 12, "text": "دُونِ", "start_ms": 972060, "end_ms": 972870}, {"i": 13, "text": "ٱللَّهِ", "start_ms": 972870, "end_ms": 973750}, {"i": 14, "text": "إِن", "start_ms": 973750, "end_ms": 975210}, {"i": 15, "text": "كُنتُمْ", "start_ms": 975210, "end_ms": 978245}, {"i": 16, "text": "صَـٰدِقِينَ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}]}